---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Daily Word — Free Daily 5-Letter Word Puzzle | Fixoraa"
  description="Play Daily Word: guess the hidden 5-letter word in 6 tries. A new puzzle every day at midnight, unlimited practice mode, streaks, stats and shareable results. Free, no signup."
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-xl px-4 pb-20 pt-8 sm:pt-12">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/games" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">🎮 Fun Zone</a>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-zinc-950 sm:text-5xl">Daily <span class="grad-text">Word</span></h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-sm text-zinc-600 sm:text-base">
        Guess the hidden <strong class="text-zinc-900">5-letter word</strong> in <strong class="text-zinc-900">6 tries</strong>.
        A fresh word drops every midnight — or warm up in Practice mode.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mode toggle -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
      <div class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-zinc-100 p-1 text-sm font-bold" role="tablist" aria-label="Game mode">
        <button id="mode-daily" class="mode-btn rounded-full px-5 py-2 transition" role="tab">📅 Daily</button>
        <button id="mode-practice" class="mode-btn rounded-full px-5 py-2 transition" role="tab">🎯 Practice</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p id="puzzle-no" class="mt-2 text-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400"></p>

    <!-- Toast -->
    <div class="relative mt-2 flex justify-center">
      <div id="toast" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 z-10 hidden whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-xl"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Board -->
    <div id="board" class="mx-auto mt-4 grid w-full max-w-[340px] grid-cols-5 gap-1.5 sm:gap-2" aria-label="Guess grid"></div>

    <!-- On-screen keyboard -->
    <div id="keyboard" class="mx-auto mt-6 w-full max-w-[500px] select-none" aria-label="On-screen keyboard"></div>

    <!-- Actions -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold">
      <button id="btn-how" class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-zinc-700 shadow-sm transition hover:border-zinc-300">❓ How to play</button>
      <button id="btn-stats" class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-zinc-700 shadow-sm transition hover:border-zinc-300">📊 My stats</button>
      <button id="btn-new-practice" class="hidden rounded-full bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-zinc-700">🔀 New word</button>
    </div>

    <!-- How to play -->
    <section id="howto" class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-950">How to play</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">
        <li>🔤 Type a <strong class="text-zinc-900">5-letter word</strong> and press Enter. You get <strong class="text-zinc-900">6 tries</strong>.</li>
        <li>🟩 <strong class="text-zinc-900">Green</strong> — the letter is in the word and in the right spot.</li>
        <li>🟨 <strong class="text-zinc-900">Yellow</strong> — the letter is in the word but in the wrong spot.</li>
        <li>⬛ <strong class="text-zinc-900">Gray</strong> — the letter is not in the word at all.</li>
        <li>📅 Everyone gets the <strong class="text-zinc-900">same word each day</strong> — it resets at midnight, your local time.</li>
        <li>🎯 <strong class="text-zinc-900">Practice mode</strong> gives you random words with unlimited replays. Daily-mode stats and streaks are tracked separately.</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="mini-tile correct">W</span><span class="mini-tile correct">O</span><span class="mini-tile present">R</span><span class="mini-tile absent">D</span><span class="mini-tile absent">S</span>
        <span class="ml-2 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500">W and O are placed right, R is elsewhere</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="mt-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-950">Daily Word FAQ</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900">Is Daily Word free to play?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Yes — completely free, unlimited practice games, no account, no signup, no ads.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900">When does the new daily word appear?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">At midnight in your local timezone. Everyone playing that day gets the same word, so you can compare scores with friends.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900">How are repeated letters scored?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">Standard rules: a letter is colored green/yellow at most as many times as it appears in the answer. Extra repeats stay gray.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900">Does Practice mode affect my streak?</summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600">No. Streaks, win rate and guess distribution are tracked for the daily puzzle only. Practice is just for fun and warm-ups.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Result overlay -->
  <div id="overlay" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center bg-zinc-950/60 p-4 backdrop-blur-sm">
    <div class="w-full max-w-sm rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-2xl">
      <h2 id="ov-title" class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950"></h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-500">The word was</p>
      <p id="ov-answer" class="mt-1 text-3xl font-black tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-950"></p>

      <h3 class="mt-6 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">Statistics</h3>
      <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center">
        <div><p id="st-played" class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950">0</p><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">Played</p></div>
        <div><p id="st-winpct" class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950">0</p><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">Win %</p></div>
        <div><p id="st-streak" class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950">0</p><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">Streak</p></div>
        <div><p id="st-max" class="text-2xl font-black text-zinc-950">0</p><p class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500">Max streak</p></div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="mt-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">Guess distribution</h3>
      <div id="ov-dist" class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-left"></div>

      <div id="ov-countdown-wrap" class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 p-3">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-500">Next daily word in</p>
        <p id="ov-countdown" class="text-2xl font-black tabular-nums text-zinc-950">--:--:--</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-5 flex gap-2">
        <button id="ov-share" class="flex-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5A5F] via-[#F43F8E] to-[#9333EA] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white shadow-lg transition hover:opacity-90">📤 Share result</button>
        <button id="ov-close" class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-700 transition hover:bg-zinc-50">✕</button>
      </div>
      <button id="ov-next-practice" class="mt-2 hidden w-full rounded-full bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-700">🔀 Play another word</button>
    </div>
  </div>

